### Bước 1: TEST ĐĂNG KÝ USER
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "0987654326",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van A"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.data.token);
%}

### Bước 1.1: TEST ĐĂNG KÝ LỖI SỐ ĐIỆN THOẠI ĐÃ TỒN TẠI
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "0987654326",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van B"
}

### Bước 2: TEST ĐĂNG NHẬP
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "0987654326",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("test_userId", response.body.data.userId);
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.data.token);
%}

### Bước 3: TEST KIỂM TRA VÍ USER_WALLET
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/accounts/user/{{test_userId}}?type=USER_WALLET
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

> {%
    client.global.set("accountId", response.body.data.id);
%}

### Bước 4: TEST LẤY VÍ USER_WALLET KHÔNG CÓ TOKEN
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/accounts/user/{{test_userId}}?type=USER_WALLET

### Bước 5: TEST ĐĂNG NHẬP SAI PASSWORD
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "0987654326",
  "password": "WrongPassword123!"
}

### Bước 6: TEST NẠP TIỀN QUA VNPAY (Tạo URL thanh toán)
POST http://localhost:8084/api/v1/payments/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "amount": 50000.00,
  "provider": "VNPAY",
  "idempotencyKey": "deposit-req-008",
  "description": "Nạp tiền qua VNPay"
}

### Bước 7: KIỂM TRA SỐ DƯ TÀI KHOẢN SAU KHI NẠP
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/accounts/{{accountId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Bước 8: TEST RÚT TIỀN (WITHDRAWAL)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "amount": 10000.00,
  "bankCode": "VCB",
  "bankAccountNumber": "19039393939393",
  "idempotencyKey": "withdraw-req-001",
  "description": "Rút tiền về tài khoản Vietcombank"
}

### Bước 9: TEST RÚT TIỀN THẤT BẠI (TRÙNG LẶP / IDEMPOTENCY)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "amount": 10000.00,
  "bankCode": "VCB",
  "bankAccountNumber": "19039393939393",
  "idempotencyKey": "withdraw-req-001",
  "description": "Rút tiền click đúp"
}

### Bước 10: TEST XEM LỊCH SỬ GIAO DỊCH
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transactions/history/{{accountId}}?page=0&size=10
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

